WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:05.140
What's your earliest memory of Mossville?

2
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:08.640
First moving to Mossville, that's my first memory of it. [laughs]

3
00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:09.660
So what did it look like?

4
00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:10.160
You know, like . . .

5
00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.380
It was wood all over the place.

6
00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:23.660
It was the main drag of Prater Road, right across the track, was a little neighborhood with about two or three houses.

7
00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:27.600
Behind there, that's where we moved to.

8
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:42.960
Queensboro, another subdivision across the street from, as you cross the railroad track on Prater, they hadn't even sold a lot over there yet.

9
00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:47.620
I remember the time when they was having the sale over there.

10
00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:55.440
We was on this side of the track, and the sale was going on on the other side of the road.

11
00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:57.040
It was nothing but woods there.

12
00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:59.000
So where did you go to school?

13
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.160
Oh, Mossville.

14
00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:00.360
Mossville?

15
00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:00.760
Where was that?

16
00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:01.760
Right here?

17
00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:04.000
Mossville down the street.

18
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.540
About a mile, half a mile from here.

19
00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:18.300
Just where the Mossville, the school . . . was first an elementary and before they built the high school.

20
00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:26.220
It was right across the street from my house, man, and I was late for school most of time, living right across the street.

21
00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:26.420
So the elementary school was here?

22
00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:27.140
Yeah.

23
00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:29.260
So where was the high school?

24
00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:37.860
They didn't have a high school right at the time when the school first opened, the elementary.

25
00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.320
And what was that, in ‘55?

26
00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:42.120
I think it was with Mossville.

27
00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:44.960
They got the high school.

28
00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:49.980
That's when they had the football team, a good football team, out of all the schools in the area.

29
00:01:49.980 --> 00:02:00.840
It was Vinton kids came to high school in Mossville, Sulphur kids went to school at Mossville.

30
00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:05.220
Westlake and Mossville.

31
00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:09.400
We had a heck of a team out of all of those surrounding areas. [Payne and Mungin laugh]
